  "description": "WebRTC signaling server for SpawnDev.RTC consumers. Hosts the WebTorrent tracker wire protocol so any ASP.NET Core app can run a room-based signaling endpoint with a single `app.UseRtcSignaling(\"/announce\")` call. Works as a dedicated signaling server for multiplayer games, collaborative tools, voice chat, agent swarms, distributed compute - and simultaneously as a WebTorrent-compatible public tracker.",
